From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thibaut Lapierre <root@epheo.eu>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/16] ovn: enable admin network policy

enable-admin-network-policy=true, the AdminNetworkPolicy and
BaselineAdminNetworkPolicy CRDs in MicroShift's CRD list, and the
controller's rights to read them and patch their status. Needs 0010's
RBAC context.

The CRD files are not carried: the SRPM stage writes them from the
payload's cluster-network-operator (src/image/payload-crds.sh), so they
always match the OVN-K that ships with them.

Covered by: vm-test (an AdminNetworkPolicy Deny cuts a pod off the
cluster network and its removal restores it).
---
 .../ovn/common/clusterrole-controller.yaml      | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml     |  1 +
 pkg/assets/crd.go                               |  2 ++
 3 files changed, 20 insertions(+)

diff --git a/assets/components/ovn/common/clusterrole-controller.yaml b/assets/components/ovn/common/clusterrole-controller.yaml
index f4781f611f20e6a5e978f19cebc56a716e9c02bc..323394004c7077593cb33a8f9d6c889c497434e5 100644
--- a/assets/components/ovn/common/clusterrole-controller.yaml
+++ b/assets/components/ovn/common/clusterrole-controller.yaml
@@ -153,3 +153,20 @@ rules:
   - get
   - list
   - watch
+# enable-admin-network-policy: the zone controller watches both kinds at
+# start and writes its status into each; the cluster manager clears stale
+# zone statuses. Same crash loop as above when the list is forbidden.
+- apiGroups: ["policy.networking.k8s.io"]
+  resources:
+  - adminnetworkpolicies
+  - baselineadminnetworkpolicies
+  verbs:
+  - get
+  - list
+  - watch
+- apiGroups: ["policy.networking.k8s.io"]
+  resources:
+  - adminnetworkpolicies/status
+  - baselineadminnetworkpolicies/status
+  verbs:
+  - patch
diff --git a/assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml b/assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml
index aff3f37e75d682e740a11421a2720b14c7801ae6..b9d6899434ee0e7e541e6695df30ef22668be72e 100644
--- a/assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml
+++ b/assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml
@@ -31,6 +31,7 @@ data:
     enable-egress-qos=false
     enable-multi-network=true
     enable-multi-networkpolicy=true
+    enable-admin-network-policy=true
 
     [gateway]
     mode=local
diff --git a/pkg/assets/crd.go b/pkg/assets/crd.go
index 23df1392d149b0b5c2c51beaebf449edd8a6732f..ec21e1c12ea26936d2e732cf51c51fd4a38b847d 100644
--- a/pkg/assets/crd.go
+++ b/pkg/assets/crd.go
@@ -40,6 +40,8 @@ var (
 		"crd/route.crd.yaml",
 		"crd/storage_version_migration.crd.yaml",
 		"crd/multi-networkpolicy.crd.yaml",
+		"crd/admin-network-policy.crd.yaml",
+		"crd/baseline-admin-network-policy.crd.yaml",
 		"components/lvms/topolvm.io_logicalvolumes.yaml",
 		"components/lvms/lvm.topolvm.io_lvmclusters.yaml",
 		"components/lvms/lvm.topolvm.io_lvmvolumegroupnodestatuses.yaml",
